    "Comprehensive guide and reference for the Antigravity Customization System. Use to explain how customizations work, their loading priority, discovery mechanisms, and to guide the creation of skills, rules, plugins, hooks, and MCP servers.": "Antigravity 自定义系统完整指南：详解技能、规则、插件、钩子与 MCP 服务器的加载机制与创建方法。",
    "Provides a comprehensive guide, quick reference, and sitemap for Google Antigravity (AGY), including the Antigravity CLI (agy), Antigravity 2.0, Antigravity IDE, Python SDK, slash commands, keybindings, and customizations (skills, rules, MCP, sidecars). Activate this skill when the user asks questions about how to use, configure, or customize Antigravity, AGY, the agy CLI, the Antigravity IDE, or Antigravity 2.0.": "Google Antigravity 完整使用指南与速查手册（涵盖 CLI、IDE、斜杠指令、快捷键与各类自定义配置）。",
    "Interactive guide to design and create a scheduled background automation. Use this skill when the user wants to create an automated or recurring scheduled task (e.g. \"summarize my emails every morning\", \"every Monday send me a to-do list\"). Also triggered by the /automation slash command.": "交互式定时后台自动化创建指南：设计与配置周期性自动执行任务（支持 /automation 指令）。",
    "How to render rich interactive HTML widgets inline in the chat or as standalone artifacts. Use this skill when you want to show the user diagrams, data visualizations, interactive controls, educational walkthroughs, or any rich visual content beyond plain text and markdown.": "在对话内或独立产物中渲染交互式 HTML 组件、图表、数据可视化与动态教学演示。",
    "Migrates the user's MCP servers, skills, slash commands, subagents, and instruction files from other coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI) into one new Antigravity plugin. Use when the user wants to bring over, import, or migrate their setup or config from another agent or tool. Don't use for installing Marketplace plugins or authoring a new plugin from scratch (use the plugin skill).": "将 Claude Code、Cursor、Codex、Gemini CLI 等工具中的 MCP、技能、指令与配置一键迁移到 Antigravity。",
    "Automatically migrate legacy workflows to modern skills across global and workspace configurations. Scans for existing workflows, creates target SKILL.md files, and safely archives old workflow files.": "自动将旧版工作流迁移为新版技能（SKILL.md），并安全归档旧工作流文件。",
    "(Preview & Quota Heavy) Run a swarm: several agents working in parallel on one task, each in its own conversation, collaborating through a shared message board. Use when the work splits into pieces that can be done at the same time, or when a second pair of eyes should check the first pair's work.": "（预览/高额度消耗）启动智能体集群：多个智能体并行协作并共享留言板，共同攻克可拆分的复杂任务。",
    "Discover UI plugin panels relevant to the current task and surface a one-click pill in chat to open (toggle) them in the side pane. Use when a running UI plugin's panel would help with what the user is doing, or right after the user enables a new UI plugin pane and a shortcut to open it is handy.": "发现与当前任务相关的 UI 插件面板，并在对话中提供一键打开侧边面板的快捷入口。"
